    "Con algo adentro reemplaza a las de fábrica enteras.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With anything in it, it replaces the built-in list entirely."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con esto prendido, un dictado sin tecla de modo elige solo según la app que tengas al frente y lo que dijiste. Si no lo tiene claro, no toca nada y tu dictado sale como salió.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With this on, dictation without a mode key picks one on its own, from the app in front of you and what you said. When it is not sure, it changes nothing and your words land as spoken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conserva su función de siempre salvo que aprietes esa combinación exacta": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps its usual action unless you press that exact combination"
