    "Elígelo desde el menú": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick it from the menu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Elígelo otra vez para reintentar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick it again to retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Empezar a dictar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Dictation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Based on %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En Ajustes del Sistema, entra a Contenido hablado → Voz del sistema → Gestionar voces y baja una voz Premium. Son archivos grandes y bajan en silencio; si una se traba, reiniciar suele arreglarlo. Las voces nuevas aparecen acá solas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In System Settings, open Spoken Content → System Voice → Manage Voices and download a Premium voice. The files are large and download quietly; a stuck download usually clears after a restart. New voices show up here on their own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En esta compu sólo hay voces de calidad normal": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only default-quality voices are installed on this Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En qué idioma transcribe tu tecla principal": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What your main key transcribes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En qué idiomas dictas": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The languages you dictate in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En una carpeta que elijas": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chosen folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En una pantalla sin notch, la píldora se cuelga debajo de la barra de menús para no tapar tus íconos. Apágalo sólo si prefieres que se ponga donde iría el notch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On a display with no notch the pill hangs below the menu bar so it never covers your status icons. Turn it off only if you want it where a notch would be."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enséñale a Dilo cómo se escriben las palabras que usas. Se quedan sólo acá. Sirven de a varias: «Espacio Digital» se arregla aunque lo dictes en dos.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Teach Dilo how the words you use are spelled. They stay on this Mac. They work across words too: “Espacio Digital” is fixed even when you say it as two."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entendido": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dismiss"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entregar el texto": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deliver text by"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error en los datos de Actividad: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Insights data error: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esa tecla ya la usa %@. Elige otra, o quítasela primero: dos modos con la misma tecla es un atajo muerto.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ already uses that key. Pick another, or take it away from that one first: two modes on one key is a dead shortcut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Escuchar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preview"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ese archivo no trae audio": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No audio in that file"
          }
        }
      }
