    "La traducción no está lista": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Translation not ready"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La voz que lee lo que seleccionas": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The voice that reads your selection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Las actualizaciones bajan desde GitHub y se verifican con una firma EdDSA antes de instalarse. La que no pasa la verificación se descarta.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updates download from GitHub and are verified with an EdDSA signature before they install. One that fails verification is thrown away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Las claves de API se guardan en el Llavero de macOS, nunca en un archivo de ajustes. El modelo de Apple corre acá mismo: no necesita clave, ni cuenta, ni internet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys live in the macOS Keychain, never in a settings file. Apple's model runs right here: no key, no account, no internet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Las de fábrica son los sonidos de duda («eh», «ehm», «mmm») y las muletillas que sólo salen cuando vienen puntuadas como pausa: «o sea,», «este,», «dale, cachái». «¿Cachái lo que digo?» se queda, porque ahí es un verbo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The built-in list is the hesitation sounds (“uh”, “um”, “mmm”) and the fillers that only go when punctuation marks them as a pause. A filler that is doing a real job in the sentence stays."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Las voces de buena calidad instaladas en esta compu": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The high-quality voices installed on this Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leer en voz alta": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read Aloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leer lo seleccionado": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read Selected Text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Licencia": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "License"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lleva un audio o un video al borde de arriba y la píldora se abre para recibirlo. Cuando termina, arrastra la transcripción a donde la quieras, o haz clic para copiarla. Si la dejas ahí, se guarda sola.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag an audio or video file to the top edge and the pill opens to take it. When it finishes, drag the transcript wherever you want it, or click to copy. Leave it and it saves itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que cambias se ve acá al instante": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you change shows up here right away"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que cambies aplica al próximo dictado.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changes apply to the next dictation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que dibuja la píldora mientras te escucha": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What the HUD draws while it listens"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que dictaste, buscable": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everything you dictated, searchable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que dictes aparece acá, con el modo que usaste.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you dictate shows up here, with the mode you used."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que recibe el modelo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What the model receives"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que terminas de dictar lo reescribe el modelo de Apple que corre acá mismo, antes de pegarlo. Nada sale de esta compu.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you finish dictating is rewritten by Apple's model running right here, before it is pasted. Nothing leaves this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que va dentro del halo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What lives inside the glow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los colores del borde que respira": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The colors of the breathing edge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los dos idiomas quedan cargados, así que cualquiera de las dos teclas responde igual de rápido. Todo corre en esta compu.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both languages stay loaded, so either key answers just as fast. Everything runs on this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los modos de fábrica no se eliminan: vuelven solos. Puedes cambiarles el nombre, las instrucciones o quitarles la tecla.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Built-in modes cannot be deleted: they come back on their own. You can rename them, change their instructions or take their key away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los sonidos de empezar y terminar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sounds a session begins and ends with"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los «eh», los «o sea» y los arranques en falso salen solos, acá mismo y sin internet. El voseo, los modismos y el spanglish técnico se quedan enteros: no son un defecto.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The “uh”s, the “I mean”s and the false starts go on their own, right here and with no internet. Dialect, slang and technical Spanglish stay whole: they are not a defect."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Línea": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
